  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a275d578e09d8ca5",
      "translationZh": "在上一篇文章（From Zero to GPU）中，我们介绍了 🤗 Kernels 项目，该项目旨在规范自定义内核的打包、分发和使用方式。我们希望这个项目既易用又安全，同时尽可能与 Hub 友好集成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e20a20613569a45",
      "translationZh": "过去几个月里，我们一直在为实现这一目标而努力。在此过程中，我们也几乎彻底重新设计了这个项目。本文将概述我们已经推出的主要更新，以及接下来的计划。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e331da0741fb6d05",
      "translationZh": "目录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f9deebc40720396b",
      "translationZh": "Kernels——一种新的仓库类型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
